OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 13 SEP
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1980FIn the early hours of the
OL,7,Fmorning, the BBC English regions
OL,8,Fprovide their final regular closedown
OL,9,Fcontinuity/news.
OL,10,
OL,11,FAs part of financial cutbacks, local
OL,12,Fcontinuity and news at closedown is
OL,13,Fbeing discontinued in the English
OL,14,Fregions. Local continuity has been
OL,15,Fprovided in the English regions five
OL,16,Fdays a week (Monday to Friday) since
OL,17,FApril 1976.
